OL,3,AFive men arrested as counter-terror
OL,4,Apolice investigate major incident near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FFive men have been arrested and remain
OL,8,Fin custody as counter-terror police are
OL,9,Fleading an investigation into a major
OL,10,Fincident near RAF Fairford
OL,12,FThey were arrested on suspicion of
OL,13,Fcommitting offences under the
OL,14,FExplosives Act, police say, after the
OL,15,Fforce received a call at about 00:45
OL,16,FBST on Sunday morning relating to
OL,17,F"three suspicious vehicles" travelling
OL,18,Ftowards the base
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1790515536
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive men arrested as counter-terror
OL,4,Apolice investigate major incident near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt a news conference, Assistant Chief
OL,8,FConstable Richard Ocone says "work to
OL,9,Festablish the full nature of the
OL,10,Fincident is ongoing", as 85 homes have
OL,11,Fbeen evacuated
OL,13,F"It all happened very quickly. We just
OL,14,Fpacked our stuff up and came here,"
OL,15,Fsays one of the evacuated residents
OL,17,FHelicopter footage shows robots
OL,18,Fapproaching vans at the scene as a
OL,19,FBritish Army bomb disposal team is
OL,20,Fcarrying out operations
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,3,C
