OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFive men arrested as counter-terror
OL,4,Apolice investigate major incident near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford
OL,6,
OL,7,FRAF Fairford has long been used as a
OL,8,Fforward operating location by the US
OL,9,Fmilitary. The country's Air Force says
OL,10,Fit "remains vigilant" following the
OL,11,Fincident
OL,13,FThe context for this is troubling and
OL,14,Fcomes amid a rising number of incidents
OL,15,Facross Europe of what's termed "hybrid
OL,16,Fwarfare", our security correspondent
OL,17,FFrank Gardner writes
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
